  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f30673b2-8e62-44b6-ac10-d776a2569eec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p>这个新的生物群系会在白天切换阶段。该生物群系拥有自己的环境音效和全局刻率，以及特殊的食物来源。此模组还略微调整了苍白花园，使其更加恐怖。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_de15cb38-ef2c-45b5-bb99-302b59780e05.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_98e40f92-2e90-4c1c-a59b-bc053b6bbc52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_faa244d4-1e78-4997-afa6-63803ef19f77.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_621e62df-d638-41d5-91ba-30dc1c04d4b7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5f644f61-058c-4aeb-b616-8b212f962148.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cd1023c4-e593-4e55-8eeb-66b4e8352074.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>",
